    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d576">

                <pb facs="0557" n="481" xml:id="pg481"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/17386</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Collector Cobb to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-03-09T16:00:00-07:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 9, 1916, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Villa thought to have gone back to his camp at point described in my March 7, 8
                    p.m. Villa positively with attacking party in Columbus.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cobb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
